  "description": "<p>The task here is to create a REST endpoint to serve as a placeholder for stats retrieval operations.</p>\n\n<p>All stats calls should live under  /&lt;context&gt;/rest/fcr:stats</p>\n\n<p>A placeholder should return the stats summary  :   /&lt;context&gt;/rest/fcr:stats<br/>\nThe summary should return  a json map.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>{\n  \"all\": {\n    \"resource_count\": 22\n  },\n  \"binaries\": {\n    \"resource_count\": 12,\n    \"byte_count\": 199\n  },\n  \"mime_types\": [\n    {\n      \"resource_count\": 7,\n      \"byte_count\": 119,\n      \"mime_type\": \"audio/mp4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"resource_count\": 5,\n      \"byte_count\": 80,\n      \"mime_type\": \"text/plain\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</pre>\n</div></div>",
